{"id":"stern","lemma":"Stern","pos":"noun","rank":1827,"glosses":["a star; a small luminous dot that can be seen on the night sky","a star; the actual celestial body","a star, a mullet, or anything that resembles such an object"],"ipa":"/ʃtɛʁn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/De-Stern.ogg/De-Stern.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Sternes","plural":"Sterne"},"formAudio":{"Sterne":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sterne.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Himmel ist voller Sterne.","en":"The sky is full of stars.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"full of"},null]},{"text":"Ich sehe einen Stern.","en":"I see a star.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Siehst du irgendwelche Sterne am Himmel?","en":"Do you see any stars in the sky?","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"any"},null,{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"sky"}]},{"text":"Die Sonne ist ein Stern.","en":"The sun is a star.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a sun"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Kann man die Sterne zählen?","en":"Can you count the stars?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to count"}]}]}